						"collapsed": false,
						"entries": [
							"- **Update Pina to 0.25.1.** Track the Pina 0.25.1 release so the program, CPI crate, clients, CLI and Surfpool tests build against the current framework, and derive the program-data PDA at compile time with `find_program_address_const`. Compute units fall 21.0% across the 11 measured instructions (87,868 to 69,398 CU), and the deployed binary shrinks by 16 bytes (92,888 to 92,872 bytes, -0.02%) relative to 0.24.0.\n  _Owner:_ [@ifiokjr](https://github.com/ifiokjr) · _Review:_ [PR #40](https://github.com/pina-rs/amm/pull/40)"
						]
